+/// Classifies [requested] against [retainedIds] (gh-1438): unique same-`n`
+/// match resolves, 2+ stay ambiguous, none falls back to the closest ids.
+ShellJobIdMatch matchShellJobId(
+  String requested,
+  Iterable<String> retainedIds,
